OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787428109
OL,3,CTennis player Nick Kyrgios suspended
OL,4,Cafter testing positive for cocaine
OL,6,FAustralian tennis player Nick Kyrgios
OL,7,Fhas been provisionally suspended after
OL,8,Fhe tested positive for cocaine.
OL,10,FOn July 22, a drug test found that a
OL,11,Fsample taken from Kyrgios at an ATP
OL,12,F250 event in Mallorca a few weeks
OL,13,Fearlier contained traces of
OL,14,Fbenzoylecgonine, a cocaine molecule.
OL,16,FCocaine, a stimulant drug, is on the
OL,17,FWorld Anti-Doping Agency (WADA)
OL,18,FProhibited List and is banned in
OL,19,Fcompetition under the Tennis Anti-
OL,20,FDoping Programme.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
