PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787428109
OL,3,CTennis player Nick Kyrgios suspended
OL,4,Cafter testing positive for cocaine
OL,6,FKyrgios has been suspended by the
OL,7,FInternational Tennis Integrity Agency
OL,8,F(ITIA) since August 4. The
OL,9,Forganisation said he has the right to
OL,10,Fappeal his suspension but "has not
OL,11,Fdone so to date".
OL,13,FIn a statement on Instagram, Kyrgios
OL,14,Fsaid: "I recently failed a drug test
OL,15,Fin Mallorca after testing positive for
OL,16,Fcocaine. I made a huge mistake, and I
OL,17,Ftake full responsibility for it.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
