PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787428109
OL,3,CTennis player Nick Kyrgios suspended
OL,4,Cafter testing positive for cocaine
OL,6,F"I'm sorry to my fans, my family, my
OL,7,Fsponsors and everyone close to me.
OL,8,FAbove all, I'm sorry to the kids who
OL,9,Ffollow me. I know the example this
OL,10,Fsets and I'm deeply disappointed in
OL,11,Fmyself."
OL,13,FThe tennis star said injuries had
OL,14,Ftaken a "huge toll" on him "both
OL,15,Fphysically and mentally". Over the
OL,16,Fpast couple of years, he has suffered
OL,17,Ffrom torn ligaments in his wrist and
OL,18,Falso injured his knee.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787428109
OL,3,CTennis player Nick Kyrgios suspended
OL,4,Cafter testing positive for cocaine
OL,6,FHe said: "My body hasn't been able to
OL,7,Fdo what my mind expects it to do, and
OL,8,Fcoming to terms with being near the
OL,9,Fend of my career has been harder than
OL,10,Fever imagined.
OL,12,F"Letting go of something that has been
OL,13,Fmy whole life is one of the hardest
OL,14,Fthings I've ever had to face. At times
OL,15,FI've felt helpless and alone. None of
OL,16,Fthat excuses what I did."
OL,18,FKyrgios announced he will be stepping
OL,19,Faway from social media and public life
OL,20,Ffor 28 days to "focus on getting
OL,21,Fmyself right".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
