OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787428109
OL,3,CTennis player Nick Kyrgios suspended
OL,4,Cafter testing positive for cocaine
OL,6,FThe 31-year-old became a professional
OL,7,Ftennis player in 2013 and was ranked
OL,8,Fnumber 13 by the Association of Tennis
OL,9,FProfessionals (ATP) in 2016.
OL,11,FHe won the men's singles at the 2022
OL,12,FWashington Open and competed in the
OL,13,F2022 Wimbledon final.
OL,15,FHe is one of a rare few who have
OL,16,Fbeaten the top three tennis champions
OL,17,F- Novak Djokovic, Roger Federer, and
OL,18,FRafael Nadal - the first time he
OL,19,Fplayed against them.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
