PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787428109
OL,3,CTennis player Nick Kyrgios suspended
OL,4,Cafter testing positive for cocaine
OL,6,FThis is not the first time Kyrgios has
OL,7,Ffaced scrutiny. In 2019, he was
OL,8,Fsuspended for 16 weeks and fined
OL,9,F$25,000 (#18,431) by ATP following
OL,10,Ffive incidents of unsportsmanlike
OL,11,Fconduct at the 2019 Cincinnati Masters
OL,12,Ftournament.
OL,14,FAt the Italian Open, he stormed off
OL,15,Fcourt, threw his racket on the floor,
OL,16,Fkicked a bottle, and tossed a chair.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
