OL,3,CTennis player Nick Kyrgios suspended
OL,4,Cafter testing positive for cocaine
OL,6,FThe ITIA said that while suspended,
OL,7,FKyrgios will not be allowed to play
OL,8,Fin, coach at, or attend any events
OL,9,Forganised or sanctioned by World
OL,10,FTennis, WTA, ATP, the Grand Slams, or
OL,11,Fany national association.
